OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal for calm after two
OL,4,Anights of trouble in Londonderry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police commander in Londonderry has
OL,7,Fappealed for calm after petrol bombers
OL,8,Fattacked her officers for the second
OL,9,Fnight running in the Waterside.
OL,11,FPetrol bombs and masonry were thrown at
OL,12,Fpolice in the Top Of The Hill area on
OL,13,FMonday.
OL,15,FThe previous night, police were
OL,16,Ftargeted with petrol bombs, fireworks
OL,17,Fand bottles in the Strabane Old Road
OL,18,Fand Irish Street areas.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,417,410,260,120,0,100
