OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal for calm after two
OL,4,Anights of trouble in Londonderry
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We recognise tensions are high, but
OL,7,Fwhat we have seen unfold in the city
OL,8,Fover the last two nights is not the
OL,9,Fresponse," area commander Ch Supt
OL,10,FGillian Kearney said.
